        "text_908007915_copy_": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "eleni.maistrellis@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "chris.kleckner@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Sep 10 2020 13:09:36 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h2><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\"><span style=\"color: #4c7d7a;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Automate workflows. Empower teams. Get back to the bedside.</span></span></span></span></span></span></h2>\n<h2>Help drive efficiency and collaboration through smart, connected workflows</h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Hospitals are facing growing challenges—staffing shortages<sup>1</sup>, rising costs<sup>2</sup> and complex systems<sup>3</sup> that can slow down care. But what if your technology worked for you instead of against you?</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">With Stryker’s enterprise workflow platform, hospitals are seeing real results:</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><b>• 80% improvement in patient length of stay</b><sup><b>4</b></sup><br>\n <b>• 66% reduction in patient falls with injury<sup>4</sup></b><br>\n <b>• $500K+ annual savings from reduced contract labor<sup>4</sup></b></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">By streamlining communication, automating workflows and reducing inefficiencies, we help your team focus on what matters most—caring for patients.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Let’s build a smart, more connected hospital together.<br>\n </span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Mar 28 2025 20:23:22 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0)",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
